# The colorbox part

This is a fork of rockbox with dynamic album art color extraction, so the theme accent colors can match what you're listening to.

- Made to work on (supposedly) all devices supported by rockbox.
- Tested on Surfans F20
- Unfortunately you need to compile it yourself

---

Heavily inspired (shamelessly copied most of the code) by [https://github.com/nuxcodes/rockpod](https://github.com/nuxcodes/rockpod) with the [themify2](https://themify.d00k.net/) theme enabled  
